ercent, below the pre-recession peak and far below the millennium peak…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.slowboring.com/p/its-time-to-take-ai-job-loss-seriously?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://www.slowboring.com/p/its-time-to-take-ai-job-loss-seriously?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/ai-links-3162025">AI links, 3/16/2025</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.slowboring.com/p/its-time-to-take-ai-job-loss-seriously?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.slowboring.com/p/its-time-to-take-ai-job-loss-seriously?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Sun, 16 Mar 2025 11:03:12 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>